From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] deps: bump russh to 0.65.0

russh 0.65.0 is the fixed release for two vendored-dependency CVEs and
four further advisories:

  GHSA-4p9f-7p9m-5vfg / CVE-2026-116773 - client unbounded allocations
    via private EXT_INFO packets (commit b33e93b)
  GHSA-9wfm-jcj8-jfv9 / CVE-2026-116696 - agent unbounded allocations
    via repeated SSH_AGENT_CONSTRAIN_CONFIRM records (commit 23aa5d2)
  GHSA-fw5c-8223-6h42, GHSA-662x-8wvj-2276, GHSA-vp5q-ff62-jwqv,
  GHSA-3hm4-p7h4-rvwp

The only source-level break affecting OpenShell is the server Handler
signature change from #785: auth_publickey now receives a
server::VerifiedPublicKey instead of &PublicKey (the key is read from its
public_key field, which the unconditional Auth::Accept here does not need).
russh also dropped its async-trait crate feature (#786); OpenShell
implements the trait methods as native async fns, so nothing else changes.

Upstream: https://github.com/Eugeny/russh/releases/tag/v0.65.0
---
 Cargo.lock                                     | 6 +++---
 crates/openshell-server/Cargo.toml             | 2 +-
 crates/openshell-supervisor-process/Cargo.toml | 2 +-
 crates/openshell-supervisor-process/src/ssh.rs | 4 ++--
 4 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 9c8d097..96d43dc 100644
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -6705,9 +6705,9 @@ dependencies = [
 
